<p>This document is a META prompt produced with Kimi, used to help <strong>summarise and merge</strong> <em>several conversation JSONs exported by the Hermes Agent</em> (here <code>output_0.json</code>, <code>output_1.json</code> and so on, exported with <code>hermes sessions export --session-id xxx /home/ubuntu/output_{n}.json</code>) into <em>one coherent report that is compatible with the rest of this blog</em>. It has to be adapted per uploaded file, and the adjustments include, but are not limited to, the <strong>input filename</strong> and the <strong>output filename</strong>.</p>
